vault.ts: recursive loadVaultContents (folders + notes + previewable files) with
per-note folder; saveNote(folder); createFolder via new hermes:fs:mkdir IPC
(main+preload+global.d.ts). index.tsx: folder tree sidebar (collapsible, +Note/
+Folder), .nemesis-prose-editor CSS wrapper (sans font, no gutter, centered
column) so notes read like notes not code, FilePreview (PDF inline via built-in
viewer, images inline, slides/docs open-external). PDF: webPreferences plugins:true.
